ld #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]The tests behind sase-ct stop failing under the full parallel lane [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]because the process-global state that leaks between tests is fixed [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]by mechanism, a leak detector gate makes the class non-recurring, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]tests/reproducible_flake_baseline.txt shrinks to only nodes proven [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]still broken, and sase-ct, sase-iy.5, sase-j4, sase-j5, and sase-j6[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]are closed on evidence.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]fix_sase_ct_flake_class.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/fix_sase_ct_flake_class.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-j7[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-j7/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Fix the confirmed xprompt VCS-tag cache leak[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]vcs-cache[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]vcs-cache - give the caches derived from workspace-provider metadata a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]real invalidation entry point and restore them on teardown, so a test [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]that fakes plugin metadata stops poisoning every later test in its [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]worker.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Build a global-state leak detector and inventory every leak in[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]the suite[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]leak-detector[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]leak-detector - build an opt-in pytest plugin that snapshots [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]process-global state around every test, distinguishes cache warming from[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]poisoning, and delivers a full-suite inventory artifact of every leak. [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Reports only; blocks nothing.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stop the flake gate from flagging node IDs that no longer [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]exist[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]stale-nodes[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]stale-nodes - bead sase-j5. Make the reproducible-flake gate skip or [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]separately report recorded node IDs absent from the collected suite, so [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a renamed test stops manufacturing pressure to bump the baseline cutoff.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Fix every inventoried leak and root-cause the residual flakes[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]fix-leaks[dim] · [dim][/dim]after vcs-cache, leak-detector[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]fix-leaks - fix every poisoning leak in the inventory by mechanism, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]deterministically reproduce and fix the bead-cluster and plan-approval [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]nodes whose cause is not yet known, and flip the leak detector into a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]blocking gate so the class cannot recur.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shrink the baseline, run the exit criteria, and close the [/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]beads[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]retire[dim] · [dim][/dim]after vcs-cache, leak-detector, stale-nodes, fix-leaks[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]retire - remove every fixed node from the flake baseline, run the four [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exit criteria non-vacuously on the combined tree, and close sase-j4, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sase-j5, sase-j6, sase-ct, and sase-iy.5 on that evidence.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-j7","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-j7.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-e536869b0f814bc5015dd7febae9ca58","started_at":"2026-08-10T19:46:25.392181+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"383540e657f9d9fd7caf7a8b86c30f20e2bed8316f3994d95bbf5a31d73b6119","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-j7.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"28da514ac411f6fef79d914e817e599d63f063eba9c10065f856d8e83bc6c3b2","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-j7.land/meta.json","size_bytes":605},"prompt":{"digest":"15810553a8644b403e39c5e6514da4eca1eb0cb8ac09cb56d599e961c3664693","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-j7.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":259},"state":{"digest":"3d2e8fb05b7482a635221bb8120a65ee77ef39bb458068613656f12a65eee19d","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-j7.land/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-j7.land","local_name":"sase-j7.land","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-j7","agent_clan_generation":"20260810154609","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-j7","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-j7","llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","reasoning_effort":"max","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-e56942a5f35cb6564746d1f5b3b57053","started_at":"20260810154614","state":"waiting"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"04e432d362128e8a8a761ae0412344dbae25a7d291486c2c1868203b9c5cf333","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-j7.4--code/chat.md","size_bytes":47891},"commits":{"digest":"61d2f19e97